{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14056","headline":"宿万固寺因寄严补阙 · 耿湋","name":"宿万固寺因寄严补阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓随樵客到青冥，因礼山僧宿化城。\n钟梵已休初入定，有无皆离本难名。\n云开半夜千林静，月上中峰万壑明。\n爲报故人雷处士，尘心终日自劳生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14056.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14056","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}